<title>USA: Community Trust Bancorp sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Community Trust Bancorp sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Trust Bancorp said it declared a special 10 percent stock dividend payable April 15 to shareholders of record March 15.</p>
<p>The dividend is in addition to the company's regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.20 per share to be paid April 1, to holders of record on March 15, the company said.</p>
</text>
